From: Abhay Singh Gill <abhaygill017@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 15:17:27 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 22/30] base: Add key generation for keybox spoofing [1/2]

The code is used from :-
https://github.com/5ec1cff/TrickyStore

This allows us to enjoy spoofing keyboxes the right way even with broken TEE.
Allow users to provide keybox XML as well.

